**/*langfuse*/data/
**/*langfuse*/*.db
**/*langfuse*/*.sqlite*
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

.cache/

# Generated workbook exports
outputs/

# Langfuse runtime state is never a checked-in report example.
reports/**/*langfuse*/
